WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.160
Running on empty?

2
00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:04.400
Here are three signs of burnout, and what can help.

3
00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:06.174
Burnout isn't weakness.

4
00:00:06.174 --> 00:00:14.700
The World Health Organization describes it as the result of chronic workplace stress that hasn't been successfully managed.

5
00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:22.000
The three signs are exhaustion, feeling distant or negative about your job, and feeling less effective at work.

6
00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:23.509
Small steps help.

7
00:00:23.509 --> 00:00:25.072
Connect with people.

8
00:00:25.072 --> 00:00:27.026
Work smarter, not harder.

9
00:00:27.026 --> 00:00:29.136
And make time for yourself.

10
00:00:29.136 --> 00:00:33.200
If it lasts, talk to your GP or occupational health.

11
00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:38.128
There's free support for health staff in England, Scotland and Wales.

12
00:00:38.128 --> 00:00:42.600
And Samaritans are there any time, on 116 123.

13
00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:49.626
Burnout is one of the topics for our first talk, pencilled in for Sunday 22 November.

14
00:00:49.626 --> 00:00:51.221
What helps you recharge?

15
00:00:51.221 --> 00:00:58.400
Tell us below, and apply to join the Igbo Healthcare Professionals Network, IHPN-UK, at the link in our bio.
